<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes secondary credit auction.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes secondary credit auction.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Money market dealers said Wednesday that the Banco de Mexico completed its two credit auctions in the secondary market as follows.</p>
<p>    AMOUNT		    MATURITY	WEIGHTED AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.3 bln		    2 days		 19.85 percent</p>
<p>    1.035 bln		  1 day		  19.82 percent</p>
<p>Figures in Mexican pesos</p>
<p>((-- Elena Vega, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289554))</p>
</text>
